[00:17.04]Great God, Jehovah, boundless in might,
[00:22.74]You have made known your love of right.
[00:30.12]Badness prevails on earth below,
[00:36.95]Causing us pain, as you well know.
[00:43.76]You are not slow, as men may contend;
[00:50.52]Your time is near for patience to end.
[00:57.23](Chorus)
[00:57.38]We look ahead with hope renewed,
[01:04.30]Praising your name in deep gratitude.
[01:10.66]One thousand years, from your point of view,
[01:15.12]Are like a day when they are through.
[01:38.52]Time now proceeds to your great day;
[01:45.38]It will arrive without delay.
[01:51.94]Though all transgression you do resent,
[01:59.06]Your heart is glad when sinners repent.
[02:05.87](Chorus)
[02:06.02]We look ahead with hope renewed,
[02:12.88]Praising your name in deep gratitude.
